[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3240.19, "timestamp": "00:54:00", "text": "它们就像你可以拔出的电池一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3245.349, "timestamp": "00:54:05", "text": "退出历史舞台，老款诺基亚 C201 手机停产。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3247.109, "timestamp": "00:54:07", "text": "所以我做了什么呢，我去了那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3249.75, "timestamp": "00:54:09", "text": "从废品场淘到几块旧主板"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3253.349, "timestamp": "00:54:13", "text": "手机修好了，换了个新机身"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3255.39, "timestamp": "00:54:15", "text": "它们上面那个东西，你知道，就是那个柜子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3260.069, "timestamp": "00:54:20", "text": "他们把这些东西卖掉牟利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3261.829, "timestamp": "00:54:21", "text": "我小时候就是这么做的，然后就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3264.71, "timestamp": "00:54:24", "text": "比如从中赚了很多钱。不像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3267.27, "timestamp": "00:54:27", "text": "钱花在了不该花的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3270.15, "timestamp": "00:54:30", "text": "应该称之为它，它会是它可以是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3273.19, "timestamp": "00:54:33", "text": "副业"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3274.79, "timestamp": "00:54:34", "text": "但钱不够，所以我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3283.51, "timestamp": "00:54:43", "text": "我还没交税。哦，不。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3285.589, "timestamp": "00:54:45", "text": "应该。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3287.67, "timestamp": "00:54:47", "text": "是的，你应该这么做。我只是在等待……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3291.19, "timestamp": "00:54:51", "text": "税务人员出现了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3293.829, "timestamp": "00:54:53", "text": "就像橙子一样，你缴税太多了。"}]